# Kalkulator

A touch calculator with an eight-digit display and addition, subtraction,
multiplication, and division. It uses the selected display and touch providers,
so the same application can run on the RP2350 touch LCD or an SDL Linux board.
AC clears the calculation, DEL removes one character, and +/- changes the sign.
Division by zero and results that do not fit show Error.
